@startuml
title T12-WF05 — AI Customer 360 Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
actor "Sales/UI" as UI
participant "NestJS Customer 360 API" as API
participant "n8n WF05\nCustomer 360" as N8N
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Gemini API" as AI

UI -> API: POST Customer 360 request (target route)
API -> API: Authenticate requester and authorize customer scope
API -> DB: Create WorkflowRun with customer/requester correlation
DB --> API: workflowRunId
API --> UI: 202 Accepted + workflowRunId
API -> N8N: POST protected internal webhook (workflowRunId, customerId, scoped requester)
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate internal request and correlation
N8N -> API: GET customer profile and linked converted Leads
API -> DB: Read Customer + related Lead records
DB --> API: Profile and lead references
API --> N8N: CRM profile
N8N -> API: GET interactions for Customer and linked Leads
API -> DB: Read Interaction records
DB --> API: Available interactions
API --> N8N: Interaction history
N8N -> API: GET available qualification/enrichment/scoring history
API -> DB: Read existing intelligence records
DB --> API: Available history or empty state
API --> N8N: Intelligence context
N8N -> API: GET follow-up enrollments/executions
API -> DB: Read follow-up history
DB --> API: Follow-up history
API --> N8N: Follow-up context
N8N -> API: GET CustomerSegment memberships
API -> DB: Read CustomerSegment assignments
DB --> API: Segment memberships or empty result
API --> N8N: Segment context
N8N -> API: GET CustomerIssue / CustomerFeedback
API -> DB: Read records only when target entities/APIs exist
DB --> API: Available records or explicit NOT_IMPLEMENTED/empty-source marker
API --> N8N: Issue/feedback evidence and data provenance
N8N -> N8N: Merge facts with source provenance and unavailable-source flags
N8N -> AI: Summarize customer profile, activity, risks and opportunities
AI --> N8N: Structured 360 summary
N8N -> N8N: Validate output against retrieved evidence
N8N -> API: Save summary and output status
API -> DB: Persist summary/provenance and update WorkflowRun
DB --> API: Snapshot/run result reference
API --> N8N: Saved snapshot reference
N8N -> N8N: Finalize workflow result
deactivate N8N
UI -> API: GET Customer 360 result by workflowRunId
API -> DB: Read WorkflowRun/snapshot output
DB --> API: Summary + source provenance
API --> UI: Customer 360 result + snapshot ID
note over API,DB
Version 1 uses CRM data already stored in PostgreSQL. CustomerIssue/CustomerFeedback
routes remain target dependencies until implemented; absent sources return an explicit
unavailable marker. Email/chat/orders/tickets/calls are not assumed connected.
end note
note over API,N8N
The browser never calls the n8n webhook directly. The backend authorizes the
customer scope, creates the run, and dispatches a protected service-to-service request.
end note
@enduml
